---

<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<link rel="icon" href="/favicon.ico" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<meta
			name="description"
			content="Ignacio Parada is an entrepreneur, software engineering leader, and educator based in Santiago, Chile."
		/>
		<title>Ignacio Parada</title>
		<style>
			:root {
				color-scheme: dark;
				font-family:
					Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
					"Segoe UI", sans-serif;
				color: #f8fafc;
				background: #020617;
			}

			* {
				box-sizing: border-box;
			}

			body {
				min-height: 100vh;
				margin: 0;
				background:
					radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18), transparent 34rem),
					radial-gradient(circle at bottom right, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.14), transparent 32rem),
					#020617;
			}

			a {
				color: inherit;
				text-decoration: none;
			}

			.page {
				width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 40px));
				margin: 0 auto;
				padding: 32px 0 56px;
			}

			header {
				display: flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: space-between;
				gap: 24px;
				padding: 8px 0 64px;
			}

			.logo {
				font-weight: 800;
				letter-spacing: -0.04em;
			}

			nav {
				display: flex;
				gap: 18px;
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}

			nav a:hover {
				color: #f8fafc;
			}

			.hero {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.1fr) 360px;
				gap: 64px;
				align-items: center;
			}

			.kicker {
				display: inline-flex;
				margin: 0 0 20px;
				padding: 8px 12px;
				border: 1px solid rgba(147, 197, 253, 0.28);
				border-radius: 999px;
				background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
				color: #bfdbfe;
				font-size: 0.78rem;
				font-weight: 800;
				letter-spacing: 0.12em;
				text-transform: uppercase;
			}

			h1 {
				max-width: 820px;
				margin: 0;
				font-size: clamp(3.4rem, 8vw, 6.8rem);
				line-height: 0.92;
				letter-spacing: -0.08em;
			}

			.lede {
				max-width: 720px;
				margin: 28px 0 0;
				color: #cbd5e1;
				font-size: clamp(1.15rem, 2vw, 1.35rem);
				line-height: 1.65;
			}

			.actions {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 14px;
				margin-top: 34px;
			}

			.button {
				display: inline-flex;
				align-items: center;
				justify-content: center;
				min-height: 46px;
				padding: 0 18px;
				border-radius: 999px;
				font-weight: 800;
			}

			.button.primary {
				background: #f8fafc;
				color: #020617;
			}

			.button.secondary {
				border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.28);
				color: #e2e8f0;
			}

			.portrait-card {
				position: relative;
				padding: 16px;
				border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.22);
				border-radius: 36px;
				background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.86), rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.42));
				box-shadow: 0 28px 90px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.38);
			}

			.portrait-card::before {
				position: absolute;
				inset: -1px;
				z-index: -1;
				border-radius: 36px;
				background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(96, 165, 250, 0.5), transparent 42%, rgba(45, 212, 191, 0.28));
				content: "";
			}

			.portrait {
				display: block;
				width: 100%;
				aspect-ratio: 1;
				object-fit: cover;
				border-radius: 26px;
			}

			.sections {
				display: grid;
				grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
				gap: 18px;
				margin-top: 72px;
			}

			.card {
				padding: 24px;
				border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
				border-radius: 24px;
				background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.62);
			}

			.card h2 {
				margin: 0 0 12px;
				font-size: 1rem;
				letter-spacing: -0.02em;
			}

			.card p {
				margin: 0;
				color: #a8b3c7;
				font-size: 0.98rem;
				line-height: 1.6;
			}

			footer {
				display: flex;
				flex-wrap: wrap;
				gap: 16px;
				justify-content: space-between;
				margin-top: 56px;
				padding-top: 24px;
				border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.18);
				color: #94a3b8;
				font-size: 0.95rem;
			}

			@media (max-width: 860px) {
				header {
					padding-bottom: 42px;
				}

				.hero {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					gap: 36px;
				}

				.portrait-card {
					max-width: 320px;
					grid-row: 1;
				}

				.sections {
					grid-template-columns: 1fr;
					margin-top: 52px;
				}
			}

			@media (max-width: 560px) {
				.page {
					width: min(100% - 28px, 1120px);
					padding-top: 22px;
				}

				header {
					align-items: flex-start;
					flex-direction: column;
					gap: 14px;
				}

				nav {
					flex-wrap: wrap;
				}

				.actions {
					align-items: stretch;
					flex-direction: column;
				}

				.button {
					width: 100%;
				}
			}
		</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="page">
			<header>
				<a class="logo" href="/">Ignacio Parada</a>
				<nav aria-label="Primary navigation">
					<a href="/repos/">Repos</a>
					<a href="mailto:yo@ignacioparada.com">Email</a>
					<a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/iparada/">LinkedIn</a>
				</nav>
			</header>

			<main>
				<section class="hero" aria-labelledby="intro-title">
					<div>
						<p class="kicker">Entrepreneur · Engineering Leader · Educator</p>
						<h1 id="intro-title">I build and lead technology teams.</h1>
						<p class="lede">
							I’m Ignacio Parada, a software engineering leader and entrepreneur based in Santiago, Chile. I’ve built products, companies, and teams across startups, cybersecurity, enterprise software, and academia — usually somewhere between strategy, engineering, and execution.
						</p>
						<div class="actions">
							<a class="button primary" href="mailto:yo@ignacioparada.com">Get in touch</a>
							<a class="button secondary" href="/repos/">View repos</a>
							<a class="button secondary" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/iparada/">View LinkedIn</a>
						</div>
					</div>

					<div class="portrait-card" aria-label="Portrait of Ignacio Parada">
						<img class="portrait" src="/images/ignacio-parada.jpg" alt="Ignacio Parada" />
					</div>
				</section>

				<section class="sections" aria-label="Highlights">
					<article class="card">
						<h2>Engineering leadership</h2>
						<p>
							Led distributed engineering teams across multiple time zones at ZeroFox, including work across impersonations, data platforms, and attack surface products.
						</p>
					</article>
					<article class="card">
						<h2>Entrepreneurship</h2>
						<p>
							Founded and grew Magnet from a small software company into a 45-person team delivering critical systems for major Latin American organizations.
						</p>
					</article>
					<article class="card">
						<h2>Teaching & systems</h2>
						<p>
							MIT SDM graduate and adjunct professor at Pontificia Universidad Católica de Chile, focused on computer security, software systems, and how teams make technology work.
						</p>
					</article>
				</section>
			</main>

			<footer>
				<span>Santiago, Chile</span>
				<span>Spanish · English · Italian</span>
			</footer>
		</div>
	</body>
</html>
